  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Barbados Port Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a loan to Barbados Port Inc. to finance certain upcoming capital expenditures at the Port of Bridgetown, including: (i) a waste-to-energy system comprising a wet-dry incinerator and a steam Rankine cycle turbine; (ii) up to 1.5 megawatts (MW) of additional rooftop solar photovoltaic capacity; and (iii) works related to certain repairs and upgrades to Berth No. 4 of the Port (the &#x201c;Project&#x201d;).</narrative>
  </description>
